# Carrion Cruiser: "mill two cards, then return a creature or Vehicle card from your graveyard to your hand". The first Cruiser
# mills Dependable Quinjet (a Vehicle card, no creature) and a Lightning Bolt; the Quinjet is the only card that may be taken
# (the Bolt and Black Lotus are refused) and comes to the hand. A second Cruiser, cast from the hand with a Mox Jet and Mox
# Ruby and Mox Pearl, mills two Islands: the graveyard then holds the Bolt, Black Lotus and Islands and no creature or
# Vehicle card, so nothing is asked and nothing returns.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Carrion Cruiser
Carrion Cruiser
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Island
Lightning Bolt
Dependable Quinjet
Island
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

